# Copy to .env.local to change where the app finds the blockchain.
# Default (no file): http://127.0.0.1:8545 — the chain on this same computer.
#
# For teammates on OTHER computers using one shared chain, put the HOST computer's
# local-network IP here (find it on the host with `ipconfig` in Windows PowerShell):
# VITE_RPC_URL=http://192.168.1.50:8545
